; CX app, text form.
[app]
name = Programs: loader
description = Test demo: list, download, validate and run signed programs from the host
kind = programs
entry = programs.txt

[args]
10.0.2.2:7003
03e489240a78d8a85713f5b6d22749632d8268e238c40b9aca99f54c44de11828d
This app holds no program. It opens the program loader on the server its
args give: a list of the server's programs, each of which can be
downloaded into the store, validated and run. A program signed by one of
the trusted keys of its args runs at once, and one from any other key
once the user confirms it. See "Loader, lister and runner (#17)" in
docs/ProgramDistribution.md.
